{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, take it. If it's heavy, move it to delivery area. Move to destination. Check object properties. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDeliveryArea    /> <Action ID = FindAlternateRoute    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Condition ID = IsPathBlocked    />",
